  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1102.06 “Certified pool operator” means a pool operator who meets the qualifications established in RSA 485-A:27-a, I, reprinted in Appendix E.\n\nSource. #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
